WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.160
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.430 --> 01:34.930
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.320 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 15]

4
01:46.350 --> 01:47.430
Comrade Teacher.

5
01:47.789 --> 01:48.870
Are you saying that

6
01:48.720 --> 01:52.110
[Zhou Enlai, CCP Politburo Standing Committee Member; Vice Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; General Political Commissar of the Red Army]

7
01:48.950 --> 01:52.200
building a pontoon bridge on the Wu River is unrealistic?

8
01:53.590 --> 01:54.720
Vice Chairman Zhou,

9
01:54.920 --> 01:56.560
I have carefully studied

10
01:56.759 --> 01:59.070
the reconnaissance data sent by the frontline troops.

11
01:57.420 --> 01:59.520
[Zhu De, Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission (CRMC); Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army]

12
01:59.710 --> 02:00.680
Look.

13
02:01.400 --> 02:04.430
From this area to this area,

14
02:02.770 --> 02:04.580
[Liu Bocheng, Chief of the General Staff of the Red Army and concurrently Commander of the Military Commission Column]

15
02:05.200 --> 02:07.860
the water flow of the Wu River is extremely fast.

16
02:08.190 --> 02:09.560
And the width of the river

17
02:09.560 --> 02:11.240
reaches more than 200 meters.

18
02:11.710 --> 02:12.870
Under these conditions,

19
02:12.870 --> 02:15.500
it is simply impossible to build a pontoon bridge.

20
02:15.500 --> 02:16.670
What's more,

21
02:17.150 --> 02:20.910
the materials and equipment needed to build a pontoon bridge...

22
02:21.310 --> 02:23.240
We don't have any of them right now.

23
02:24.430 --> 02:25.490
But our problem now

24
02:25.700 --> 02:27.190
is not whether we can build a bridge,

25
02:27.190 --> 02:29.120
but that we must build a bridge.

26
02:29.400 --> 02:30.400
Comrade Teacher,

27
02:30.870 --> 02:32.730
the enemy has already burned all the ferry boats

28
02:32.730 --> 02:34.000
along the hundred-mile route.

29
02:34.000 --> 02:35.240
If we can't build a bridge,

30
02:35.240 --> 02:38.280
even if the vanguard regiments can break through the Wu River crossing,

31
02:38.280 --> 02:39.590
it will be hard to guarantee that the main force

32
02:39.590 --> 02:41.190
can cross the river on time.

33
02:41.680 --> 02:43.000
Commanders,

34
02:43.240 --> 02:45.240
why can't I get through to you?

35
02:45.480 --> 02:46.480
Comrade Teacher,

36
02:47.030 --> 02:48.630
don't worry, take your time.

37
02:48.710 --> 02:50.800
I understand how you feel,

38
02:51.140 --> 02:53.090
but we have to face reality.

39
02:53.480 --> 02:55.550
I have checked all the data.

40
02:59.710 --> 03:00.590
Look.

41
03:03.560 --> 03:04.590
This section,

42
03:05.840 --> 03:06.910
and this section.

43
03:09.360 --> 03:11.080
This section has it written very clearly.

44
03:11.080 --> 03:13.280
No textbook says

45
03:13.630 --> 03:17.000
that a pontoon bridge can be built under these conditions.

46
03:17.240 --> 03:18.710
Unless it's a miracle.

47
03:18.910 --> 03:21.400
Miracles often come from practice.

48
03:21.750 --> 03:23.310
Mao, where did you come from?

49
03:23.310 --> 03:24.590
I went to the Wu River

50
03:25.710 --> 03:27.570
and did an on-site investigation

51
03:28.750 --> 03:31.560
about building a bridge.

52
03:31.740 --> 03:32.630
Comrade Zedong,

53
03:32.630 --> 03:33.840
do you have any good ideas?

54
03:33.840 --> 03:35.329
There are specialties in every profession.

55
03:35.329 --> 03:36.290
Let's ask

56
03:36.680 --> 03:38.590
Winter boy to introduce it.

57
03:39.280 --> 03:40.740
Quick, warm up by the fire.

58
03:44.010 --> 03:44.930
In the evening,

59
03:45.360 --> 03:46.900
our Engineer Company, following Chairman Mao's instructions,

60
03:46.900 --> 03:48.730
[Mao Zedong, Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

61
03:47.000 --> 03:48.730
held an expanded "Zhuge Liang" meeting.

62
03:48.730 --> 03:50.990
[Wang Yaonan, Commander of the Engineer Battalion, Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

63
03:48.840 --> 03:50.150
Besides the comrades from the Engineer Company,

64
03:50.150 --> 03:51.560
we also invited many local

65
03:51.560 --> 03:53.630
boatmen, carpenters, blacksmiths, and bamboo weavers to participate.

66
03:53.630 --> 03:54.680
Everyone suggested

67
03:54.680 --> 03:56.240
the method of making bamboo rafts out of moso bamboo

68
03:56.240 --> 03:58.190
and then building a pontoon bridge.

69
03:58.190 --> 03:59.250
This is a good idea!

70
03:59.450 --> 04:00.800
We can use local materials!

71
04:00.800 --> 04:01.610
Is there a specific plan?

72
04:01.610 --> 04:02.050
Yes.

73
04:03.430 --> 04:04.840
First, tie the bamboo rafts into three layers,

74
04:04.840 --> 04:06.110
which can resist enemy artillery fire

75
04:06.110 --> 04:07.770
and carry more people across.

76
04:07.870 --> 04:09.630
A fellow villager who is a bamboo weaver suggested

77
04:09.630 --> 04:11.560
weaving bamboo strips into ropes to use as cables.

78
04:11.560 --> 04:14.620
These ropes get stronger the longer they soak in water.

79
04:14.740 --> 04:17.920
Then how do we solve the problem of fixing the bamboo rafts?

80
04:17.920 --> 04:19.380
The water flow is too fast.

81
04:19.560 --> 04:21.290
Fix them with heavy anchors...

82
04:22.360 --> 04:25.040
There are two kinds of heavy anchors for fixing bamboo rafts.

83
04:25.040 --> 04:27.120
One is to fill bamboo baskets with large stones,

84
04:27.120 --> 04:28.360
and then use three sharpened bamboos

85
04:28.360 --> 04:30.120
to make an anchor head stuck in the bottom of the water.

86
04:30.120 --> 04:30.770
In addition...

87
04:30.770 --> 04:32.040
The local folks also helped us

88
04:32.040 --> 04:34.480
collect over a dozen anvils from blacksmith shops.

89
04:34.480 --> 04:35.940
Each weighs hundreds of pounds,

90
04:35.940 --> 04:38.310
heavy enough to sink to the bottom of the river and anchor the bamboo rafts.

91
04:38.310 --> 04:38.750
Great.

92
04:38.870 --> 04:39.720
Good.

93
04:40.310 --> 04:42.000
Solving the bridge-building problem

94
04:42.000 --> 04:43.000
means we have met

95
04:43.170 --> 04:45.430
the necessary condition for the main force to cross the river quickly.

96
04:45.430 --> 04:46.190
Yes.

97
04:46.560 --> 04:48.159
The problem of building the pontoon bridge is solved.

98
04:48.159 --> 04:49.350
We need to speed up.

99
04:49.870 --> 04:52.240
According to the enemy codes deciphered by the Second Bureau,

100
04:52.240 --> 04:55.040
Zhou Hunyuan's troops, with four main Divisions,

101
04:55.380 --> 04:57.400
are rushing to the south bank of the Wu River.

102
04:57.400 --> 04:59.000
We don't have much time left.

103
04:59.010 --> 05:00.460
If a sneak crossing fails,

104
05:00.460 --> 05:01.840
we can only force a crossing.

105
05:01.840 --> 05:03.950
While the vanguard regiments force the crossing,

106
05:03.950 --> 05:06.390
the engineers will build the bridge simultaneously.

107
05:06.390 --> 05:08.480
Before Zhou Hunyuan's troops arrive,

108
05:08.480 --> 05:09.830
we will cross the Wu River.

109
05:09.830 --> 05:10.390
This way,

110
05:10.410 --> 05:13.670
we avoid the crisis of fighting with our backs to the river.

111
05:14.720 --> 05:16.320
It seems this is the only way.

112
05:17.310 --> 05:18.480
The Wu River is like

113
05:18.480 --> 05:20.520
the Tongtian River in the Journey to the West.

114
05:20.520 --> 05:23.080
To obtain the true scriptures

115
05:23.480 --> 05:24.580
and achieve enlightenment,

116
05:24.580 --> 05:26.310
we must first cross this river.

117
05:26.860 --> 05:29.490
The Tongtian River had the old turtle to help ferry,

118
05:29.490 --> 05:32.000
but our Red Army can only rely on ourselves now.

119
05:32.000 --> 05:33.950
I believe our soldiers,

120
05:34.310 --> 05:35.510
who could fight their way out

121
05:35.510 --> 05:36.830
of the Xiang River,

122
05:37.630 --> 05:40.159
will once again create heroic feats.

123
05:40.340 --> 05:42.200
Chairman, Commander-in-Chief,

124
05:42.720 --> 05:44.940
I will go to the riverbank to direct the crossing now.

125
05:44.940 --> 05:45.730
Good.

126
05:46.120 --> 05:47.650
With Bocheng the Dragon King here,

127
05:47.650 --> 05:49.420
we will definitely cross the Tongtian River.

128
05:49.420 --> 05:51.670
Comrade Bocheng, we await your good news.

129
05:51.670 --> 05:53.130
Comrade Yaonan, let's go.

130
05:53.190 --> 05:53.720
Let's go.

131
05:53.740 --> 05:54.540
Wait.

132
05:55.040 --> 05:56.830
I'll go with you.

133
05:57.630 --> 06:01.830
I want to witness the miracle in the history of engineering with my own eyes.

134
06:01.830 --> 06:02.860
Not witness,

135
06:03.220 --> 06:04.720
but personally participate.

136
06:04.720 --> 06:06.240
Genuine knowledge comes from practice.

137
06:06.240 --> 06:08.670
You are now a teacher at the Red Army University?

138
06:08.670 --> 06:09.750
Yes, Chairman.

139
06:09.830 --> 06:10.950
Good, go ahead.

140
06:57.159 --> 06:57.950
Comrades!

141
06:58.070 --> 06:59.510
Everyone must pay attention!

142
06:59.510 --> 07:01.680
These bamboos are divided into male and female.

143
07:01.680 --> 07:02.680
The ones tied with hemp rope

144
07:02.680 --> 07:03.680
are male bamboos.

145
07:03.750 --> 07:04.870
Do not cut them.

146
07:05.120 --> 07:07.040
Leave a few female bamboos nearby.

147
07:07.040 --> 07:09.800
Do not cut the tender and thin bamboos either.

148
07:09.950 --> 07:10.920
Do you know why?

149
07:11.270 --> 07:13.510
This is to leave the seeds of the revolution.

150
07:13.510 --> 07:16.190
Next year, a bamboo forest will grow here again!

151
07:16.270 --> 07:17.120
Yes. Hurry!

152
07:21.240 --> 07:25.750
[Jiangjiehe Crossing, Wu River, Weng'an, Guizhou]

153
07:31.190 --> 07:33.000
You must find a way to

154
07:33.510 --> 07:34.980
cross the Wu River as quickly as possible.

155
07:34.980 --> 07:35.740
Zhuchang

156
07:35.770 --> 07:39.500
is the location of the Guizhou Army's river defense headquarters.

157
07:42.500 --> 07:43.500
Report!

158
07:46.510 --> 07:47.670
Reporting to the leaders.

159
07:47.670 --> 07:49.560
We have prepared a total of 60 bamboo rafts,

160
07:49.560 --> 07:51.560
divided into three large groups to cross the Wu River.

161
07:51.560 --> 07:52.920
The 1st Battalion is the commando team.

162
07:52.920 --> 07:54.190
The 2nd Battalion provides fire cover.

163
07:54.190 --> 07:56.320
The 3rd Battalion is the reserve team.

164
07:57.430 --> 07:58.800
When the 4th Regiment crosses the river,

165
07:58.800 --> 07:59.920
bridge building must be carried out simultaneously.

166
07:59.790 --> 08:02.470
[Zhang Yunyi, Deputy Chief of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army and concurrently Director of the Operations Bureau]

167
07:59.950 --> 08:01.150
Everything is ready.

168
08:01.280 --> 08:02.690
This time, the bridge building task

169
08:02.470 --> 08:04.940
[Geng Biao, Commander of the 4th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

170
08:02.720 --> 08:04.310
will be carried out by the engineer company of the 1st Front Red Army

171
08:04.310 --> 08:06.510
and the engineer company of the Special Branch Battalion of the Cadre Regiment,

172
08:06.510 --> 08:08.320
under the unified command of Comrade Wang Yaonan.

173
08:08.320 --> 08:10.670
[Yang Chengwu, Political Commissar of the 4th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

174
08:08.600 --> 08:09.800
In order to strengthen the firepower,

175
08:09.800 --> 08:10.950
we have also transferred

176
08:10.950 --> 08:12.630
Comrade Zhao Zhangcheng from the mortar company

177
08:12.630 --> 08:14.050
to support the 4th Regiment's combat.

178
08:14.050 --> 08:14.810
Good.

179
08:15.190 --> 08:16.790
Geng Biao, Comrade Chengwu.

180
08:17.040 --> 08:18.510
Whether the Central Committee and the main force of the Red Army

181
08:18.510 --> 08:20.400
can successfully cross the Wu River

182
08:20.400 --> 08:22.330
depends on your success or failure today.

183
08:22.330 --> 08:24.380
I believe you will definitely be able to complete

184
08:24.380 --> 08:26.280
the task of crossing the Wu River this time.

185
08:26.280 --> 08:28.430
I am waiting for your good news of victory.

186
08:28.430 --> 08:29.000
Yes!

187
08:39.039 --> 08:39.520
Come.

188
08:40.240 --> 08:40.840
Like this.

189
09:06.300 --> 09:07.690
Move out!

190
09:39.510 --> 09:40.750
Comrades, give it your all!

191
09:40.750 --> 09:42.510
Avenge Mao Zhenhua!

192
11:33.540 --> 11:34.460
Your hand!

193
11:37.430 --> 11:38.360
Give it to me!

194
11:46.710 --> 11:47.640
Hold tight!

195
11:53.370 --> 11:54.280
Hold tight!

196
13:19.510 --> 13:20.390
Mao Zhenhua.

197
13:21.870 --> 13:22.960
It's Mao Zhenhua!

198
13:23.960 --> 13:25.090
This kid didn't die!

199
13:25.520 --> 13:26.980
All five of them are there.

200
13:31.510 --> 13:32.270
Mao Zhenhua.

201
13:32.320 --> 13:33.450
Mao Zhenhua, you...

202
13:38.690 --> 13:41.310
[Mao Zhenhua, Company Commander of the 3rd Company, 1st Battalion, 4th Regiment]

203
13:39.280 --> 13:41.440
Wang Youcai, hurry up!

204
13:42.030 --> 13:43.960
Comrades, hurry! Charge!

205
14:20.750 --> 14:22.810
The 1st Battalion has also advanced.

206
14:23.080 --> 14:24.050
I'll go command the 2nd Battalion.

207
14:24.050 --> 14:24.840
Okay.

208
14:35.150 --> 14:36.270
Hurry up!

209
14:44.340 --> 14:45.180
How are you?

210
14:45.750 --> 14:46.600
Are you hurt?

211
14:46.620 --> 14:47.390
I'm not hurt.

212
14:47.720 --> 14:48.270
I'm fine!

213
14:48.960 --> 14:49.620
Are you okay?

214
14:49.620 --> 14:50.650
I'm fine!

215
14:55.760 --> 14:56.790
Fire!

216
15:11.510 --> 15:13.410
This is the enemy's river defense reserve.

217
15:13.410 --> 15:14.550
This is the critical moment.

218
15:14.550 --> 15:15.810
We must beat them back!

219
15:16.210 --> 15:17.210
I need artillery!

220
15:18.080 --> 15:19.930
Tell Zhao Zhangcheng to provide artillery support.

221
15:19.930 --> 15:21.290
Yes! Go!

222
15:40.750 --> 15:43.680
Regiment Commander Geng! Regiment Commander Geng!

223
15:44.150 --> 15:44.870
Regiment Commander Geng!

224
15:44.210 --> 15:46.350
[Zhao Zhangcheng, Artillery Company Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

225
15:45.220 --> 15:46.870
Director Zhang asked me to come and support you.

226
15:46.870 --> 15:47.630
Great!

227
15:47.910 --> 15:49.310
Tell me, which one to hit?

228
15:52.840 --> 15:53.570
Hit that one!

229
15:54.000 --> 15:55.930
The group of enemies rushing down!

230
15:56.390 --> 15:56.960
Charge!

231
15:58.010 --> 15:58.890
Charge!

232
16:02.600 --> 16:03.600
Set up the mortar!

233
16:41.910 --> 16:44.680
Company Commander Zhao, are these all the shells we have?

234
16:44.680 --> 16:45.280
Yes.

235
16:45.300 --> 16:46.760
Why didn't you bring more?

236
16:46.910 --> 16:48.970
Our company only has these four left.

237
16:51.130 --> 16:53.040
Don't worry, it's enough.

238
17:11.510 --> 17:12.400
You missed!

239
17:12.510 --> 17:14.190
Regiment Commander Geng, don't worry.

240
17:14.190 --> 17:15.319
That was a test shot.

241
17:15.960 --> 17:17.160
The enemy is too close to us.

242
17:17.160 --> 17:19.020
We can't blow up our own comrades.

243
17:48.980 --> 17:51.260
Zhao Zhangcheng, you are amazing!

244
17:53.770 --> 17:55.620
Comrades, charge!

245
17:55.830 --> 17:56.750
Charge!

246
18:52.030 --> 18:53.580
The 4th Regiment has charged up.

247
18:53.580 --> 18:55.280
The pontoon bridge is almost at the opposite bank.

248
18:55.280 --> 18:56.190
Good.

249
18:56.720 --> 18:59.920
The natural barrier of the Wu River has finally been conquered by us.

250
18:59.920 --> 19:00.590
Chen Guang.

251
19:00.860 --> 19:01.920
Your 2nd Division must not stop.

252
19:01.920 --> 19:03.550
The main force must cross the river immediately

253
19:03.550 --> 19:05.680
and continue to attack the Guizhou Army's

254
19:05.680 --> 19:07.420
river defense headquarters in Zhuchang.

255
19:07.420 --> 19:08.180
Yes!

256
19:11.290 --> 19:14.200
Comrade Yunyi, let's send a telegram to the Military Commission,

257
19:14.200 --> 19:16.620
requesting the Military Commission Column and the 5th Red Army Corps

258
19:16.620 --> 19:18.840
to cross the river from here as originally planned.

259
19:18.840 --> 19:19.430
Okay.

260
19:19.450 --> 19:20.090
Prepare to send a telegram.

261
19:20.090 --> 19:20.960
Yes!

262
19:22.110 --> 19:23.640
Prepare to send a telegram!

263
19:24.280 --> 19:25.190
Send it.

264
19:26.510 --> 19:29.720
Request the Military Commission Column and the 5th Red Army Corps

265
19:29.720 --> 19:31.250
to follow the original plan

266
19:31.360 --> 19:33.020
and cross the river from here.

267
19:33.300 --> 19:35.410
Bocheng, Yunyi.

268
20:00.750 --> 20:01.550
Amazing.

269
20:02.040 --> 20:02.910
Truly amazing.

270
20:04.400 --> 20:06.390
I heard this is the first bridge

271
20:06.410 --> 20:07.610
ever built on the Wu River.

272
20:07.610 --> 20:08.440
That's right.

273
20:09.110 --> 20:10.590
Today, the 1st Red Regiment also

274
20:10.590 --> 20:11.780
broke through the Huilongchang crossing

275
20:11.780 --> 20:13.160
and built a pontoon bridge.

276
20:13.160 --> 20:15.480
The 10th Red Regiment, the vanguard of the 3rd Red Army Corps

277
20:15.480 --> 20:16.780
is currently advancing smoothly.

278
20:16.780 --> 20:17.900
It is expected that they will reach

279
20:17.900 --> 20:19.880
the Chashanguan crossing in two days.

280
20:19.880 --> 20:21.160
If nothing unexpected happens,

281
20:21.160 --> 20:23.030
the first three bridges in the history of the Wu River

282
20:23.030 --> 20:24.690
were all built by our Red Army.

283
20:25.030 --> 20:26.110
What did I tell you?

284
20:26.510 --> 20:28.270
With our Dragon King Bocheng here,

285
20:28.270 --> 20:30.270
there is no river we cannot conquer!

286
20:30.970 --> 20:33.100
Chairman, you flatter me.

287
20:33.800 --> 20:35.130
Without your decision,

288
20:35.440 --> 20:36.840
a one-eyed dragon like me

289
20:36.910 --> 20:38.940
probably wouldn't even be able to reach the Wu River.

290
20:38.940 --> 20:41.240
Bocheng, don't be so modest.

291
20:41.000 --> 20:43.650
[Bo Gu (Qin Bangxian), General Secretary of the CPC Central Committee; Li De, Comintern military adviser]

292
20:41.640 --> 20:43.310
If we want to rest well for two days,

293
20:43.310 --> 20:44.840
breaking through the Wu River is only the first step.

294
20:44.750 --> 20:46.580
[Wang Jiaxiang, Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; Director of the General Political Department of the Red Army]

295
20:45.350 --> 20:48.160
We also need to capture Zunyi as quickly as possible.

296
20:48.160 --> 20:49.440
The Military Commission has decided

297
20:49.440 --> 20:52.970
to use the 2nd Red Division and the Military Commission Cadre Regiment as the main force

298
20:52.970 --> 20:55.190
to undertake the task of capturing Zunyi City,

299
20:55.190 --> 20:58.450
with our 3rd Red Army Corps responsible for coordinating the action.

300
20:58.450 --> 21:00.450
This battle is of great importance.

301
21:00.680 --> 21:02.530
We would like to ask you, the Chief of the General Staff,

302
21:02.530 --> 21:03.630
to go to the front line in person

303
21:03.630 --> 21:05.310
and unify the command of all troops' actions.

304
21:05.310 --> 21:06.640
What do you think?

305
21:06.840 --> 21:08.480
Military orders are absolute.

306
21:08.480 --> 21:10.610
I will certainly not fail the mission.

307
21:11.040 --> 21:12.040
Comrade Bocheng.

308
21:12.110 --> 21:14.260
[Luofu (Zhang Wentian), Member of the Political Bureau Standing Committee of the CPC Central Committee; Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

309
21:12.400 --> 21:13.530
Then we can just wait

310
21:13.750 --> 21:15.640
to have a peaceful meeting in Zunyi.

311
21:15.640 --> 21:16.400
Sure.

312
21:16.440 --> 21:17.410
When the time comes,

313
21:17.410 --> 21:20.210
I will personally welcome all of you into the city.

314
21:20.560 --> 21:22.920
Personally welcoming us is formalism.

315
21:23.600 --> 21:25.200
Let's have some pragmatism.

316
21:25.450 --> 21:28.730
Get us a few bowls of Zunyi's mutton soup noodles.

317
21:29.000 --> 21:31.550
Zunyi's mutton soup noodles are uniquely delicious.

318
21:31.550 --> 21:32.810
Let's have a feast.

319
21:33.180 --> 21:33.700
Sure.

320
21:35.570 --> 21:36.570
Geng the boy.

321
21:37.030 --> 21:38.490
Can we cross the river now?

322
21:38.640 --> 21:39.700
Yes, Chairman Mao!

323
21:39.970 --> 21:41.830
Please cross the river, leaders!

324
21:42.130 --> 21:43.090
Look, Mao.

325
21:43.270 --> 21:44.990
Geng Biao is a Regiment Commander now.

326
21:44.990 --> 21:47.350
Don't call him by his nickname in front of everyone.

327
21:47.350 --> 21:48.550
I accept the criticism.

328
21:48.550 --> 21:49.680
It just slipped out.

329
21:53.440 --> 21:54.510
Comrade Li De.

330
21:54.690 --> 21:59.290
The Wu River really didn't become a second Xiang River.

331
21:59.500 --> 22:02.750
When I was organizing the workers' movement in Shuikoushan,

332
22:02.750 --> 22:03.880
when we had meetings,

333
22:03.880 --> 22:05.340
we just let him keep watch.

334
22:05.480 --> 22:07.290
At that time, we all called him Geng the boy.

335
22:07.290 --> 22:08.490
He was only thirteen.

336
22:08.640 --> 22:09.770
Times have changed.

337
22:09.960 --> 22:10.810
Now Geng the boy

338
22:10.810 --> 22:13.200
has grown into the unstoppable Brave Geng.

339
22:13.200 --> 22:13.920
Brave Geng!

340
22:13.940 --> 22:14.620
Here!

341
22:16.030 --> 22:17.950
The natural moat has become a thoroughfare!

342
22:17.950 --> 22:18.510
Let's go!

343
22:19.600 --> 22:20.270
Let's go.

344
22:25.590 --> 22:28.960
From January 2 to 6, 1935,

345
22:29.550 --> 22:32.680
the Central Red Army, from Jiangjiehe, Huilongchang,

346
22:32.680 --> 22:34.350
Chashanguan, and other ferries,

347
22:34.350 --> 22:37.610
successfully crossed the natural barrier of the Wu River.

348
22:37.790 --> 22:38.880
The enemy's attempt to encircle and annihilate the Red Army

349
22:38.880 --> 22:42.440
on the south bank of the Wu River came to nothing.

350
22:49.890 --> 22:53.490
[Machangping, Pingyue County, Guizhou]

351
22:51.370 --> 22:54.680
Commander Wu, this is a local specialty.

352
22:53.600 --> 22:55.240
[Wang Jialie, Commander of the Kuomintang's 25th Army and Chairman of Guizhou Provincial Government]

353
22:54.710 --> 22:57.320
Commander Xue, you've traveled a long way.

354
22:57.180 --> 22:59.600
[Xue Yue, Frontline Commander of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army and Commander of the 1st Army Group]

355
22:57.400 --> 22:58.560
It's been a hard journey.

356
22:58.560 --> 23:01.160
Now that the army has arrived, Guizhou is safe.

357
23:01.190 --> 23:02.190
You're too kind.

358
23:02.510 --> 23:04.120
The Generalissimo's orders are absolute.

359
23:04.120 --> 23:06.430
I, Xue Yue, must come as ordered.

360
23:06.780 --> 23:08.580
Thank you for your hospitality.

361
23:08.850 --> 23:10.050
It's the least I could do.

362
23:10.050 --> 23:12.180
Come, let me offer a toast to everyone.

363
23:12.330 --> 23:14.010
Commander Xue, Commander Wu.

364
23:14.390 --> 23:15.510
It's been a hard journey.

365
23:15.510 --> 23:17.720
Today, I have specially prepared

366
23:17.720 --> 23:19.270
good local wine from Guizhou.

367
23:19.270 --> 23:21.500
Drink a few more glasses to relieve your fatigue, okay?

368
23:21.500 --> 23:23.060
Come, cheers.

369
23:26.120 --> 23:27.250
Please, have a seat.

370
23:28.320 --> 23:29.140
Commander Xue.

371
23:29.140 --> 23:30.470
Let me fill it up for you.

372
23:31.020 --> 23:31.670
Commander.

373
23:31.670 --> 23:33.530
This is our local specialty dish.

374
23:33.750 --> 23:34.440
Come, bro.

375
23:34.460 --> 23:35.300
Boling.

376
23:36.820 --> 23:39.210
How about we talk in private?

377
23:40.980 --> 23:41.560
Okay.

378
23:42.720 --> 23:43.720
Finally here.

379
23:44.550 --> 23:45.270
Jianru (Bai Huizhang),

380
23:45.270 --> 23:46.370
Liangquan (He Zhizhong),

381
23:46.370 --> 23:48.230
keep Commander Wu company for me.

382
23:48.640 --> 23:49.200
Okay.

383
23:49.680 --> 23:50.200
Come.

384
23:55.660 --> 23:57.800
[Wu Qiwei, Commander of the 1st Route Army, 2nd Army Group of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army]

385
23:57.140 --> 23:57.940
Commander Wu.

386
24:00.630 --> 24:01.390
Come.

387
24:01.830 --> 24:02.960
Boling.

388
24:03.240 --> 24:06.890
My wife and I have specially prepared a small gift for you.

389
24:11.000 --> 24:13.130
It's just a token of our appreciation.

390
24:14.010 --> 24:14.970
Chairman Wang.

391
24:15.760 --> 24:17.890
I, Xue Yue, came all the way to Guizhou.

392
24:17.990 --> 24:20.160
I'm not here for your generous gift.

393
24:20.230 --> 24:21.600
Of course, of course.

394
24:21.830 --> 24:23.790
I just don't know how to thank you.

395
24:27.410 --> 24:31.050
Now Zhu and Mao's Communist army has crossed the Wu River

396
24:31.430 --> 24:33.360
and is heading straight for Zunyi.

397
24:34.880 --> 24:36.310
The situation is urgent.

398
24:37.510 --> 24:40.040
Relying solely on our Guizhou Army to resist,

399
24:40.590 --> 24:42.590
we absolutely cannot hold them off.

400
24:43.510 --> 24:45.840
So suppressing the communists in Guizhou

401
24:46.030 --> 24:49.790
will have to rely entirely on your Central Army.

402
24:50.480 --> 24:51.340
Chairman Wang.

403
24:52.550 --> 24:54.750
Chairman Wang, you flatter me too much.

404
24:55.720 --> 24:57.590
The encirclement and suppression of Zhu and Mao's Communist army

405
24:57.590 --> 25:00.790
relies on the Generalissimo taking charge of the overall situation,

406
25:00.790 --> 25:02.510
gathering the efforts of provinces

407
25:02.510 --> 25:04.270
of Sichuan, Hunan, Yunnan, and Guizhou,

408
25:04.270 --> 25:05.870
along with the Central Army.

409
25:07.680 --> 25:09.510
But the current situation in northern Guizhou...

410
25:09.510 --> 25:11.040
I think the most urgent task

411
25:11.400 --> 25:15.240
is for me to help you stabilize the city defenses of Guiyang.

412
25:16.160 --> 25:17.720
Only by holding Guiyang,

413
25:18.030 --> 25:20.070
can you, as the Chairman of the Guizhou Provincial Government,

414
25:20.070 --> 25:22.130
possibly continue in your position.

415
25:29.160 --> 25:30.680
Then...

416
25:31.760 --> 25:33.560
I'll listen to you, Commander Xue.

417
25:33.560 --> 25:36.470
We'll hold Guiyang first, then make other plans.

418
25:37.470 --> 25:38.470
That's right.

419
25:41.720 --> 25:42.790
Boling,

420
25:43.640 --> 25:44.790
I'll send someone

421
25:45.350 --> 25:47.700
to deliver this to your place later.

422
25:47.840 --> 25:48.440
No need.

423
26:01.020 --> 26:07.990
[Shenxishui Town, on the outskirts of Zunyi, Guizhou]

424
26:02.110 --> 26:03.310
How's the situation?

425
26:03.440 --> 26:05.400
Leader, the battle went very smoothly.

426
26:05.400 --> 26:07.100
According to your instructions,

427
26:07.100 --> 26:08.710
we wiped out an entire Battalion

428
26:08.710 --> 26:10.090
of the Guizhou Army's 9th Regiment stationed in the town.

429
26:10.090 --> 26:12.240
[Zhu Shuiqiu, Commander of the 6th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

430
26:10.590 --> 26:12.680
We killed the Battalion Commander and some resisters,

431
26:12.680 --> 26:13.840
and took the rest as prisoners.

432
26:13.840 --> 26:14.990
Not a single one escaped.

433
26:14.990 --> 26:15.470
Good.

434
26:15.530 --> 26:17.790
Your 6th Regiment fought beautifully this time.

435
26:17.790 --> 26:19.880
Our Division has always had the 4th Regiment as the vanguard.

436
26:19.880 --> 26:21.230
It's finally our Regiment's turn,

437
26:21.230 --> 26:22.770
[Wang Jicheng, Political Commissar of the 6th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

438
26:21.310 --> 26:22.470
and everyone is full of energy.

439
26:22.470 --> 26:23.190
Good.

440
26:23.410 --> 26:24.800
Between brother Regiments,

441
26:24.800 --> 26:27.400
there should be this kind of competitive spirit.

442
26:27.400 --> 26:28.840
Have the prisoners been interrogated?

443
26:28.840 --> 26:29.510
Yes.

444
26:29.810 --> 26:30.680
Leader, look.

445
26:31.060 --> 26:32.850
This is a sketch of Zunyi's city defenses

446
26:32.850 --> 26:35.240
drawn for us by a captured Guizhou Army Company Commander.

447
26:35.240 --> 26:36.530
According to the prisoners,

448
26:36.530 --> 26:38.400
the Guizhou Army currently defending Zunyi

449
26:38.400 --> 26:39.550
has a total of three Regiments,

450
26:39.550 --> 26:41.750
stationed in the new city, the old city,

451
26:41.830 --> 26:42.610
and Honghuagang.

452
26:42.610 --> 26:43.350
They already know

453
26:43.350 --> 26:44.870
that our Red Army has crossed the Wu River,

454
26:44.870 --> 26:45.780
and they are very nervous.

455
26:45.780 --> 26:48.790
Although the Guizhou Army's combat effectiveness is not strong,

456
26:48.790 --> 26:50.650
Zunyi's city walls are very high,

457
26:50.720 --> 26:51.840
making it easy to defend and hard to attack.

458
26:51.840 --> 26:53.030
We must try our best to avoid

459
26:53.030 --> 26:55.290
getting into a stalemate with the enemy.

460
26:55.530 --> 26:57.050
Do you have any good ideas?

461
27:00.420 --> 27:01.220
Leader,

462
27:01.680 --> 27:03.480
we do have a battle plan

463
27:03.680 --> 27:04.830
and were just about to report it to you.

464
27:04.830 --> 27:05.440
Speak.

465
27:05.880 --> 27:08.070
We plan to send a commando team,

466
27:08.350 --> 27:10.440
disguised as retreating Guizhou Army soldiers,

467
27:10.440 --> 27:12.230
to use the prisoners to trick them into opening Zunyi's gates.

468
27:12.230 --> 27:13.090
Trick the city?

469
27:13.090 --> 27:13.890
Yes.

470
27:16.580 --> 27:18.110
How did you come up with this?

471
27:18.110 --> 27:19.350
Didn't you instruct us

472
27:19.350 --> 27:21.080
to fight well, minimize casualties,

473
27:21.080 --> 27:23.040
save bullets, and use more wisdom?

474
27:30.030 --> 27:30.680
Leader,

475
27:30.830 --> 27:32.690
if you think this plan is not good,

476
27:32.790 --> 27:34.030
we will organize a forced attack.

477
27:34.030 --> 27:35.020
Anyway, our 6th Regiment

478
27:35.020 --> 27:36.680
will guarantee to take Zunyi.

479
27:37.590 --> 27:39.190
This is of course a good idea.

480
27:39.200 --> 27:40.060
This is wisdom.

481
27:40.200 --> 27:41.790
I completely agree with your plan.

482
27:41.790 --> 27:42.920
I just have one suggestion.

483
27:42.920 --> 27:44.920
Our comrades disguised as the enemy

484
27:45.160 --> 27:46.220
must act like them.

485
27:46.350 --> 27:48.310
They absolutely cannot be seen through by the enemy.

486
27:48.310 --> 27:50.110
Leader, don't worry about that.

487
27:50.170 --> 27:52.310
I plan to have the 1st Battalion Commander, Zeng Baotang, go

488
27:52.310 --> 27:53.790
and serve as the captain of the commando team.

489
27:53.790 --> 27:55.400
This man's combat ability

490
27:55.510 --> 27:57.480
and reconnaissance skills are both exceptionally strong.

491
27:57.480 --> 27:58.510
Zeng Baotang?

492
27:58.960 --> 28:00.750
When crossing the second blockade,

493
28:00.750 --> 28:03.270
he was the war hero who led the raid on Chengkou.

494
28:03.270 --> 28:04.310
Yes, that's him.

495
28:04.610 --> 28:05.300
Good.

496
28:05.680 --> 28:08.140
I'll also hand over the Corps' special service company to Zeng Baotang

497
28:08.140 --> 28:09.270
for unified command.

498
28:09.270 --> 28:10.270
I also suggest you

499
28:10.510 --> 28:12.960
assign all the buglers in the Regiment to the commando team.

500
28:12.960 --> 28:14.110
After successfully tricking your way into the city,

501
28:14.110 --> 28:15.110
make a lot of noise

502
28:15.510 --> 28:17.790
to create the illusion of a massive army attacking.

503
28:17.790 --> 28:18.790
All is fair in war.

504
28:18.940 --> 28:19.750
Yes!

505
28:22.880 --> 28:25.000
On January 6, 1935,

506
28:25.420 --> 28:27.770
Zeng Baotang, Commander of the 1st Battalion of the 6th Red Regiment,

507
28:26.590 --> 28:28.180
[Zeng Baotang, Commander of the 1st Battalion of the 6th Red Regiment, 2nd Division]

508
28:28.080 --> 28:30.190
led the 3rd Company and the reconnaissance platoon,

509
28:30.190 --> 28:32.640
along with over 20 buglers from the Regiment,

510
28:32.640 --> 28:34.170
dressed in enemy uniforms,

511
28:34.200 --> 28:37.060
and had captives lead the way to the Zunyi city gate.

512
28:37.560 --> 28:38.880
Under the cover of night,

513
28:38.880 --> 28:42.480
they got the defenders to open the gate by calling out as planned.

514
28:42.590 --> 28:43.850
As soon as the gate opened,

515
28:43.850 --> 28:45.120
the Red Army immediately rushed in

516
28:45.120 --> 28:46.510
and attacked the gate tower.

517
28:46.510 --> 28:47.160
Then,

518
28:47.190 --> 28:48.510
the over 20 buglers

519
28:48.530 --> 28:50.660
sounded the charge together.

520
28:50.860 --> 28:53.570
The follow-up troops quickly advanced into the city,

521
28:53.570 --> 28:57.290
and the three defending regiments hastily abandoned the city and fled.

522
28:57.290 --> 28:58.720
In the early morning of the 7th,

523
28:58.720 --> 29:01.070
the Red Army completely occupied Zunyi.

524
29:01.440 --> 29:02.440
By the 15th,

525
29:02.720 --> 29:04.310
the 2nd Division of the 1st Red Army Corps

526
29:04.310 --> 29:06.590
advanced to Loushanguan and Tongzi.

527
29:06.960 --> 29:10.420
The 1st Red Division assembled at Xinjie, northeast of Zunyi.

528
29:10.430 --> 29:12.680
The 15th Red Division was at Laopuchang.

529
29:12.680 --> 29:14.960
The 3rd Red Army Corps was south of Zunyi,

530
29:14.960 --> 29:18.070
at Daobashui, Shangjichang, and Nanbai Town,

531
29:18.070 --> 29:20.460
controlling the road from Zunyi to Guiyang

532
29:20.460 --> 29:22.480
and guarding the north bank of the Wu River.

533
29:22.480 --> 29:25.610
The 9th Red Army Corps was at Meitan, northeast of Zunyi.

534
29:25.810 --> 29:28.980
The 5th Red Army Corps was at Zhuchang, southeast of Zunyi.

535
29:28.980 --> 29:32.670
The Cadre Regiment garrisoned Zunyi as guards.

536
29:33.070 --> 29:33.940
By then,

537
29:34.030 --> 29:37.070
the Central Red Army controlled

538
29:37.070 --> 29:38.910
the vast area of northern Guizhou centered on Zunyi,

539
29:38.910 --> 29:40.590
which created favorable conditions

540
29:40.590 --> 29:42.210
for the Zunyi Conference.

541
29:42.440 --> 29:44.880
The Red Army also got a rare rest period

542
29:44.880 --> 29:47.010
since the beginning of the Long March.

543
29:47.680 --> 29:49.560
When the Red Army arrives, the poor smile.

544
29:49.560 --> 29:51.920
The warlord troops with opium pipes flee for their lives.

545
29:51.920 --> 29:54.530
We fight landlords and overthrow local tyrants

546
29:54.530 --> 29:56.290
to distribute grain and money.

547
29:56.480 --> 29:58.110
The army loves the people, and the people support the army.

548
29:58.110 --> 30:01.920
Army and people are like fish and water, happy and joyful, joyful indeed.

549
30:01.920 --> 30:02.830
Chairman!

550
30:09.830 --> 30:10.880
Vice Chairman Zhou.

551
30:10.880 --> 30:11.830
We've been waiting for you.

552
30:11.830 --> 30:12.830
Comrade Bocheng.

553
30:13.480 --> 30:14.080
Chen Geng.

554
30:14.270 --> 30:14.990
Leaders.

555
30:16.170 --> 30:17.630
You've had a hard journey.

556
30:22.960 --> 30:24.070
Comrade Li De.

557
30:28.730 --> 30:29.730
Comrade Bocheng.

558
30:30.320 --> 30:32.190
You did a great job taking Zunyi.

559
30:33.110 --> 30:34.240
But along the way,

560
30:34.400 --> 30:35.840
I heard many comrades

561
30:36.270 --> 30:38.200
have a lot of complaints about you.

562
30:38.660 --> 30:39.420
A lot?

563
30:39.440 --> 30:40.220
A lot.

564
30:43.070 --> 30:44.470
What kind of complaints?

565
30:45.030 --> 30:47.360
Commander-in-Chief, please tell him...

566
30:48.100 --> 30:49.380
Comrade Liu Bocheng.

567
30:50.200 --> 30:51.880
For this attack on Zunyi,

568
30:52.180 --> 30:54.750
didn't the Military Commission assign you three Divisions

569
30:54.750 --> 30:56.010
plus a Cadre Regiment?

570
30:56.160 --> 30:56.770
Yes.

571
30:57.150 --> 30:58.420
But how did you fight?

572
31:02.400 --> 31:05.000
You took Zunyi with just one Battalion.

573
31:09.250 --> 31:12.120
[Chen Geng, Commander of the Cadre Regiment]

574
31:09.400 --> 31:10.790
Reporting to the leaders!

575
31:10.790 --> 31:13.720
I also want to complain about the Chief of the General Staff.

576
31:13.720 --> 31:15.790
Our Cadre Regiment finally received

577
31:15.890 --> 31:17.160
the task of being the vanguard.

578
31:17.160 --> 31:18.480
We were all gearing up.

579
31:18.850 --> 31:20.780
But Zunyi was taken just like that.

580
31:21.140 --> 31:23.630
We went from a vanguard regiment to a guard regiment.

581
31:23.630 --> 31:25.660
He still told us to gear up.

582
31:26.000 --> 31:28.070
All we have left is gearing up.

583
31:28.340 --> 31:30.140
Look how big the complaints are.

584
31:30.510 --> 31:31.810
You cherish soldiers like gold.

585
31:31.810 --> 31:33.050
This startled me.

586
31:34.620 --> 31:35.450
Leaders.

587
31:35.480 --> 31:37.710
We didn't expect it to go so smoothly either.

588
31:37.710 --> 31:40.030
Now the local people are spreading the word

589
31:40.030 --> 31:40.960
that our Red Army

590
31:41.110 --> 31:43.270
crossed the Wu River on water horses.

591
31:43.750 --> 31:45.350
When the vanguard troops first entered the city,

592
31:45.350 --> 31:46.880
the people gathered around

593
31:47.000 --> 31:49.960
to see what a water horse looked like.

594
31:51.310 --> 31:52.770
There are no water horses.

595
31:53.200 --> 31:54.660
But there is a Dragon King,

596
31:54.680 --> 31:56.640
and that is our Comrade Liu Bocheng.

597
31:56.640 --> 31:57.920
As the Book of Changes says,

598
31:57.920 --> 32:00.310
The flying dragon is in the sky; it is favorable to see the great man.

599
32:00.310 --> 32:02.920
It's time for a gentleman to realize his ambition.

600
32:02.920 --> 32:04.850
Comrade Bocheng made a good start.

601
32:05.440 --> 32:06.640
Thank you, Chairman.

602
32:06.750 --> 32:08.720
Leaders, let's enter the city.

603
32:08.920 --> 32:09.590
Okay.

604
32:09.750 --> 32:11.490
Comrades, let's enter the city.

605
32:11.490 --> 32:11.860
Okay.

606
32:12.830 --> 32:13.270
Come.

607
32:15.120 --> 32:16.120
Comrade Wentian.

608
32:16.120 --> 32:17.650
We've been waiting for you.

609
32:21.440 --> 32:23.680
Welcome, Commander-in-Chief Zhu Mao!

610
32:23.680 --> 32:25.160
Welcome, Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army.

611
32:25.160 --> 32:25.920
Mao.

612
32:26.020 --> 32:28.500
Who is this Commander-in-Chief named Zhu Mao?

613
32:28.500 --> 32:31.310
Zhu and Mao are like one person, inseparable.

614
32:31.330 --> 32:32.680
Welcome, Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army.

615
32:32.680 --> 32:34.270
Long live the Communist Party of China!

616
32:34.270 --> 32:35.220
Thank you. Thank you.

617
32:35.220 --> 32:36.420
Welcome, Commander-in-Chief Zhu Mao.

618
32:36.420 --> 32:37.310
Thank you all.

619
32:37.310 --> 32:39.650
Welcome, Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army.

620
32:39.650 --> 32:40.650
Comrade Bocheng.

621
32:41.230 --> 32:42.490
I really didn't expect

622
32:42.720 --> 32:45.830
the vanguard troops to do such a good job with the masses.

623
32:45.830 --> 32:46.700
This scene

624
32:47.000 --> 32:49.980
makes me feel like I'm back in the Central Soviet Area.

625
32:49.980 --> 32:51.640
We can't take credit for this.

626
32:51.830 --> 32:53.550
It was organized by a local

627
32:53.790 --> 32:55.920
Party member in Zunyi named Zhou Sihe.

628
32:56.030 --> 32:58.640
Hearing that our Central Red Army had turned to Guizhou,

629
32:58.640 --> 33:00.790
he specially established a

630
33:00.790 --> 33:02.440
Friends of the Red Army Association in Zunyi

631
33:02.440 --> 33:04.240
to organize local students and the masses

632
33:04.240 --> 33:06.510
to welcome our Central Red Army into the city.

633
33:06.510 --> 33:07.480
Very good.

634
33:07.830 --> 33:10.200
Wherever there are our Party member comrades,

635
33:10.200 --> 33:12.060
there will be an unfallen red flag

636
33:12.350 --> 33:14.010
and the support of the masses.

637
33:14.210 --> 33:14.820
Yes.

638
33:14.940 --> 33:15.670
In addition,

639
33:15.820 --> 33:18.160
when the 1st Red Army Corps first entered Zunyi,

640
33:18.160 --> 33:19.360
they publicly issued

641
33:19.550 --> 33:22.400
"Regulations on Implementing Policies upon Entering the Cities",

642
33:22.400 --> 33:23.960
requiring the troops to carry out their work

643
33:23.960 --> 33:25.590
according to the actual situation in Zunyi,

644
33:25.590 --> 33:26.980
protecting industry and commerce,

645
33:26.980 --> 33:28.960
ensuring that various economic activities in the city

646
33:28.960 --> 33:30.560
can be carried out normally,

647
33:30.590 --> 33:33.270
and minimizing the burden on Zunyi City.

648
33:33.830 --> 33:35.750
The common people are very appreciative

649
33:35.750 --> 33:37.790
and supportive of this move by our Red Army.

650
33:37.790 --> 33:39.030
The support of the masses

651
33:39.030 --> 33:42.000
is the guarantee of victory for our Workers' and Peasants' Red Army.

652
33:42.000 --> 33:42.880
Jiaxiang,

653
33:43.290 --> 33:46.070
I think the Twelve Slogans on Entering Zunyi

654
33:46.370 --> 33:48.970
drafted by your General Political Department

655
33:49.030 --> 33:51.480
and the Eight Points for Attention should also be conveyed as soon as possible,

656
33:51.480 --> 33:52.750
so that the masses in Zunyi

657
33:52.750 --> 33:54.500
can see the spiritual outlook of our Red Army.

658
33:54.500 --> 33:56.400
Comrade Li Fuchun has already conveyed them.

659
33:56.400 --> 33:58.240
In addition, the Military Commission also decided

660
33:58.240 --> 34:00.200
to give every commander and fighter

661
34:00.200 --> 34:02.200
half a silver dollar of military pay,

662
34:02.200 --> 34:04.800
so that everyone can shop freely in Zunyi City.

663
34:05.000 --> 34:05.730
This is good.

664
34:05.740 --> 34:07.240
It's been a tough journey for everyone.

665
34:07.240 --> 34:07.640
Exactly,

666
34:07.640 --> 34:09.190
we should have a good rest.

667
34:09.190 --> 34:09.670
That's right.

668
34:09.670 --> 34:10.340
Vice Chairman Zhou!

669
34:10.340 --> 34:11.270
Comrade Deng Fa,

670
34:13.560 --> 34:15.190
have the residences for the leading comrades

671
34:15.190 --> 34:15.909
of the Central Committee and the Military Commission been arranged?

672
34:15.909 --> 34:16.870
They have all been arranged.

673
34:16.780 --> 34:19.090
[Deng Fa, Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee; Director of the State Political Security Bureau]

674
34:16.960 --> 34:18.340
The Red Army General Headquarters is set up at

675
34:18.340 --> 34:19.510
Baitianshun Sauce Shop,

676
34:19.510 --> 34:21.000
which is the newly built mansion of Bai Huizhang,

677
34:21.000 --> 34:22.230
Commander of the 2nd Division of the Guizhou Army.

678
34:22.230 --> 34:24.360
The environment there is very good and it's spacious,

679
34:24.360 --> 34:25.190
suitable for office work.

680
34:25.190 --> 34:26.900
You, Commander-in-Chief Zhu, Chief of the General Staff Bocheng,

681
34:26.900 --> 34:29.760
and the comrades of the headquarters all live here.

682
34:29.960 --> 34:31.130
Where do the other comrades live?

683
34:31.130 --> 34:32.670
Chairman Mao, Chairman Zhang, and Director Wang

684
34:32.670 --> 34:33.780
live in the Yi Mansion.

685
34:33.780 --> 34:35.840
It's an independent two-story small western-style building,

686
34:35.840 --> 34:37.400
very quiet and with a good environment.

687
34:37.400 --> 34:38.590
Comrade Bo Gu and Comrade Li De

688
34:38.590 --> 34:39.480
have also been arranged residences,

689
34:39.480 --> 34:41.210
not far from the headquarters.

690
34:41.280 --> 34:41.840
Good.

691
34:42.960 --> 34:43.590
Vice Chairman Zhou.

692
34:43.590 --> 34:45.000
Just in time, Chen Geng.

693
34:45.400 --> 34:46.070
This time,

694
34:46.670 --> 34:48.230
although your Cadre Regiment is asked

695
34:48.230 --> 34:49.920
to do the work of the guard troops...

696
34:49.920 --> 34:51.050
I was just joking...

697
34:53.480 --> 34:55.360
The task is very arduous.

698
34:55.440 --> 34:57.590
You must ensure safety in Zunyi City.

699
34:58.230 --> 34:59.480
Please rest assured, Vice Chairman Zhou.

700
34:59.480 --> 35:01.670
Our Cadre Regiment has completely taken over

701
35:01.670 --> 35:03.280
the guard work of the whole city of Zunyi,

702
35:03.280 --> 35:04.940
ensuring nothing goes wrong.

703
35:15.440 --> 35:16.510
Let's go.

704
35:29.500 --> 35:34.610
[Commendation Conference for Heroes and Model Workers in the Breakthrough at the Wu River]

705
35:33.840 --> 35:34.880
Comrades!

706
35:35.400 --> 35:36.550
I now announce

707
35:37.320 --> 35:39.510
the only winner of the Third-Class Red Star Medal

708
35:39.510 --> 35:43.040
in this Commendation Conference for Heroes and Model Workers.

709
35:43.070 --> 35:46.630
When he lost contact with the main force,

710
35:46.660 --> 35:49.240
he remained calm, seized the opportunity,

711
35:49.720 --> 35:52.240
destroyed the enemy's firepower point,

712
35:52.260 --> 35:55.800
and assisted the river-crossing commando battalion to land smoothly!

713
35:55.800 --> 35:57.920
He is Comrade Mao Zhenhua,

714
35:58.180 --> 36:02.000
Company Commander of the 3rd Company, 1st Battalion, 4th Regiment, 2nd Division

715
36:02.000 --> 36:03.590
[Li Fuchun, Representative Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

716
36:02.360 --> 36:03.470
of the 1st Red Army Corps!

717
36:03.470 --> 36:04.700
Good!

718
36:05.400 --> 36:06.280
Good job!

719
36:06.550 --> 36:07.510
Good!

720
36:10.000 --> 36:11.150
Good!

721
36:13.190 --> 36:16.280
Now, let's welcome Comrade Mao Zedong,

722
36:16.480 --> 36:19.070
Chairman of the Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic,

723
36:19.070 --> 36:20.110
to present the award to Mao Zhenhua!

724
36:20.110 --> 36:22.630
Good! Good!

725
36:35.240 --> 36:36.720
Thank you, Chairman.

726
36:44.110 --> 36:46.150
Mao, I should thank you.

727
36:46.320 --> 36:47.400
Without you,

728
36:47.960 --> 36:49.880
I couldn't have crossed the river.

729
36:49.880 --> 36:51.760
It's because of your good leadership, Chairman.

730
36:51.760 --> 36:52.800
So,

731
36:53.070 --> 36:54.360
on behalf of myself,

732
36:54.400 --> 36:57.330
I also want to give you a special prize.

733
37:02.280 --> 37:04.030
I brought them from Liping.

734
37:11.380 --> 37:12.640
Now they are all yours.

735
37:13.630 --> 37:16.480
Good! Good! Good!

736
37:18.290 --> 37:19.600
Thank you, Chairman!

737
37:28.340 --> 37:29.230
Comrades,

738
37:29.510 --> 37:31.670
now let's welcome our Commander-in-Chief,

739
37:31.670 --> 37:33.400
Comrade Zhu De, to give us a speech!

740
37:33.400 --> 37:34.880
Good!

741
37:43.360 --> 37:44.360
Comrades,

742
37:44.920 --> 37:48.120
since the Central Red Army turned to Guizhou from Liping,

743
37:48.480 --> 37:50.230
in just over 20 days,

744
37:50.670 --> 37:52.710
we have crossed Guizhou,

745
37:52.880 --> 37:55.040
broken through the Wu River, captured Zunyi,

746
37:55.040 --> 37:56.480
and occupied Tongzi,

747
37:56.660 --> 37:59.280
initially realizing the goal of advancing into northern Guizhou

748
37:59.280 --> 38:02.640
and creating a new Soviet area on the border of Sichuan and Guizhou.

749
38:02.640 --> 38:03.970
This is a great victory.

750
38:04.230 --> 38:06.230
It is the result of the hard work

751
38:06.480 --> 38:08.400
of all the commanders and fighters of the Red Army.

752
38:08.400 --> 38:10.470
That is truly something to celebrate!

753
38:10.470 --> 38:11.840
Good!

754
38:20.840 --> 38:21.720
Comrades,

755
38:22.190 --> 38:23.720
what we are holding today is

756
38:23.920 --> 38:27.920
the commendation conference for heroes and model workers breaking through the Wu River.

757
38:27.920 --> 38:29.840
But in my mind,

758
38:30.140 --> 38:32.070
there is actually a group of heroes

759
38:33.630 --> 38:35.960
who were not able

760
38:36.360 --> 38:38.690
to attend this commendation conference.

761
38:38.740 --> 38:40.490
But without them,

762
38:40.840 --> 38:43.900
we would not have been able to break through the Wu River

763
38:44.280 --> 38:46.030
or enter Zunyi.

764
38:46.730 --> 38:47.520
They

765
38:47.630 --> 38:50.830
are all the comrades-in-arms who sacrificed themselves

766
38:51.110 --> 38:52.470
to cover us

767
38:52.660 --> 38:55.060
in the Battle of the Xiang River a month ago.

768
38:55.590 --> 39:00.360
They include Du Zhongmei, Chief of Staff of the 4th Division of the 3rd Corps,

769
39:00.960 --> 39:03.190
Shen Shuqing, Regiment Commander of the 10th Regiment,

770
39:03.190 --> 39:06.440
Huang Mianchang, Regiment Commander of the 14th Regiment of the 5th Division,

771
39:06.440 --> 39:10.290
and Yi Dangping, Political Commissar of the 5th Regiment of the 2nd Division of the 1st Red Army Corps.

772
39:10.290 --> 39:11.440
Among them,

773
39:11.470 --> 39:14.230
many didn't even leave their names.

774
39:14.960 --> 39:16.830
Especially the comrades-in-arms

775
39:16.830 --> 39:19.000
of the 34th Division of the 5th Red Army Corps.

776
39:19.000 --> 39:21.110
In order to cover us crossing the river,

777
39:21.110 --> 39:24.510
they fought fiercely with the enemy for five days and nights!

778
39:26.150 --> 39:28.210
And the whole division was wiped out.

779
39:28.730 --> 39:30.200
We got the news

780
39:30.230 --> 39:31.750
from the newly captured newspapers.

781
39:31.750 --> 39:34.920
Comrade Chen Shuxiang, Division Commander of the 34th Division,

782
39:34.920 --> 39:36.780
was captured due to his injuries.

783
39:37.110 --> 39:38.370
While being escorted,

784
39:38.730 --> 39:40.440
he tore off his own intestines

785
39:41.230 --> 39:42.560
and died a heroic death.

786
39:46.840 --> 39:48.690
He was only 29 years old.

787
39:49.810 --> 39:50.690
Comrades,

788
39:51.480 --> 39:52.630
I want to say,

789
39:52.810 --> 39:55.480
no matter how far our journey is,

790
39:56.110 --> 39:57.400
and no matter where we eventually

791
39:57.400 --> 39:59.560
settle down,

792
40:00.280 --> 40:01.710
we must never forget

793
40:02.240 --> 40:04.030
the soldiers who sacrificed their lives.

794
40:04.030 --> 40:05.510
They did not die in vain.

795
40:06.320 --> 40:09.670
The Red Army will eventually find the right direction

796
40:10.030 --> 40:11.910
and achieve final victory.

797
40:12.550 --> 40:15.360
This victory belongs to us,

798
40:15.860 --> 40:17.260
and it belongs to them!

799
40:17.760 --> 40:21.020
It belongs to the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army,

800
40:21.070 --> 40:25.030
fighting for honor and faith!

801
40:25.510 --> 40:28.710
Good, good, good!

802
40:30.150 --> 40:32.920
Good, good, good!

803
40:32.960 --> 40:35.110
Good, good, good!

804
40:48.990 --> 40:54.120
[Guizhou, Guiyang]

805
40:49.410 --> 40:51.610
Commander, what did Commander Xue say?

806
40:51.920 --> 40:53.190
Did you see him?

807
40:53.190 --> 40:54.300
So many people are waiting!

808
40:54.300 --> 40:55.760
What's the situation? Say something...

809
40:55.760 --> 40:57.430
Can I get a sip of water first?

810
40:57.630 --> 40:58.860
Okay, okay, okay.

811
41:06.140 --> 41:07.750
I didn't see him!

812
41:10.030 --> 41:10.810
What do you mean?

813
41:10.810 --> 41:12.140
Xue refused to see you?

814
41:13.110 --> 41:16.280
They said he's not in Guiyang.

815
41:16.750 --> 41:19.710
Chiang called him to Xikou, Fenghua for a meeting.

816
41:20.070 --> 41:21.740
What? He left Guiyang

817
41:21.760 --> 41:23.170
without even saying a word to you?

818
41:23.170 --> 41:25.620
[Bai Huizhang, Division Commander of the 25th Army of the KMT Army]

819
41:23.440 --> 41:24.510
Does he even respect you

820
41:24.510 --> 41:25.780
as the Chairman of Guizhou Province?

821
41:25.780 --> 41:28.440
He was called away directly by Generalissimo Chiang!

822
41:28.440 --> 41:29.630
I am nothing to him!

823
41:30.400 --> 41:32.290
He left? Then what about Zunyi?

824
41:32.320 --> 41:33.380
What else can we do?

825
41:34.280 --> 41:35.360
We wait!

826
41:36.100 --> 41:38.460
Commander, that's easy for you to say!

827
41:38.880 --> 41:42.140
The Communist army didn't occupy your house and business!

828
41:44.100 --> 41:45.330
How arrogant.

829
41:47.450 --> 41:48.620
Bai Huizhang,

830
41:50.640 --> 41:52.840
you are getting more and more insolent.

831
41:53.690 --> 41:55.480
[Wan Shufen, Wang Jialie's wife]

832
41:54.790 --> 41:56.190
Madam, I was wrong.

833
41:56.330 --> 41:59.330
I misspoke out of desperation.

834
42:00.000 --> 42:02.920
But the situation in Zunyi is extremely urgent.

835
42:03.320 --> 42:04.550
If you are anxious,

836
42:05.110 --> 42:06.520
then take your Second Division

837
42:06.520 --> 42:08.210
and take Zunyi back.

838
42:09.440 --> 42:10.280
I...

839
42:10.540 --> 42:13.270
Whoever is anxious should go take Zunyi.

840
42:13.610 --> 42:15.250
If you don't have the ability,

841
42:15.250 --> 42:17.370
go back and wait for orders.

842
42:17.390 --> 42:19.620
Don't make things difficult for your Commander here.

843
42:19.620 --> 42:20.650
Leave!

844
42:22.400 --> 42:23.110
Yes.

845
42:30.790 --> 42:32.190
Did Xue Yue really leave?

846
42:32.400 --> 42:33.150
He left.

847
42:33.570 --> 42:35.450
But I saw him before he left.

848
42:36.590 --> 42:37.550
What did he say?

849
42:37.570 --> 42:38.900
What else could he say?

850
42:39.080 --> 42:41.080
He beat around the bush!

851
42:42.320 --> 42:45.110
One moment he said our Guizhou Army is useless,

852
42:45.400 --> 42:49.000
the next he said he needs to mobilize the Sichuan, Hunan, and Yunnan Armies,

853
42:49.000 --> 42:50.000
which takes time.

854
42:50.160 --> 42:51.690
But he just wouldn't tell me

855
42:51.880 --> 42:54.810
whether the Central Army will cross the river or not!

856
42:55.950 --> 42:59.720
Now I really hope the Communist army is just

857
43:00.390 --> 43:02.720
taking a break and passing through Zunyi.

858
43:02.800 --> 43:04.000
The sooner they leave, the better.
